    <detaileddescription>
<para>Base class for graph vertex traversals.</para><para><ref refid="structVertex" kindref="compound">Vertex</ref> traversals increment their current position stopping only when a vertex is entered. They have dereference (&quot;*&quot;) and arrow (&quot;-&gt;&quot;) operators and a <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1Algorithm_1_1GraphVertexTraversal_1aea0f7171e8c2a2db23463dea6188bb4f" kindref="member">next</ref> method that return vertex nodes from the graph. </para>    </detaileddescription>
